    "instruction": "Create a capsule pull tab using one exact line/arc outer profile extrusion, not polygonal approximations. Units mm, origin [0,0,0], +Z extrusion from z=0 to z=6. Outer bounds x=0..40, y=0..20. The straight sides run from [10,0] to [30,0] and [30,20] to [10,20]. Right semicircle is centered [30,10] radius10, through [40,10]; left semicircle centered [10,10] radius10, through [0,10]. Cut one diameter6 through-bore at x=10,y=10 along Z. Then round the complete top OUTER perimeter at z=6 with a constant R1 fillet. Use seed points [20,0,6], [40,10,6], [20,20,6], [0,10,6] with picking tolerance0.01. Do not round the bore or bottom perimeter. Keep all dimensions and these feature locations exactly.",
